{"slug":"1-ROBUX-Be-an-Admin-Tower-KickerUniversal-136132","_id":"69b0a12a06c4bd6aa824bd30","title":"KickerUniversal","game":{"_id":"69b0a12a06c4bd6aa824bd2d","gameId":80902227341034,"name":"[1 ROBUX] Be an Admin Tower","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-fe7a531f83e9c1a16199e44386066960-6068e160206a.png","placeId":80902227341034},"features":"What this script does:\nGenesis Oversight is a scanning utility designed to find and use specific RemoteEvents (KickPlayerRemote) within a game's environment. Once a remote is found, it allows you to remove players from the server.\n\nCompatible Games:\nThis script is mainly functional on \"Admin\" style games, such as:\n\n1 Robux Be an Admin Tower\n\nFree Admin experiences\n\nAny similar games using standard admin remote structures.\n\nHow to use:\n\nExecute the script.\n\nClick the \"Scan Remotes\" button to find the game's vulnerability.\n\nOnce found, you can use the following methods:\n\nPC Users: Hold Left Control + Left Click on a player to copy their kick command to your clipboard.\n\nMobile Users: After scanning, use the chat commands manually:\n\n/kick [Username] (to kick a specific player)\n\n/kick all (to kick everyone except whitelisted users)","tags":["Kick","fun"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/GenesisCode-000/Genesis.Oversight/refs/heads/Main/KickerUniversal.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6801bdad415edd9f6a2fc34f","username":"Slow_Moon2447","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6801bdad415edd9f6a2fc34f-1780773170938.png","status":"offline","id":"6801bdad415edd9f6a2fc34f","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"verified":false,"views":2088,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/80902227341034-1773183274162.png","likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-10T22:54:34.177Z","keyLink":"","executes":1301,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69b